<title>NEW ZEALAND: YACHTING TEAM NZ BEAT ROYAL DORSET IN MINI AMERICA'S CUP.</title>
<headline>YACHTING TEAM NZ BEAT ROYAL DORSET IN MINI AMERICA'S CUP.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Team New Zealand beat Britain's Royal Dorset Yacht Club four races to one in the mini-America's Cup yachting finals on Auckland's Waitemata Harbour on Sunday.</p>
</text>
